{"id":"beleidigung","lemma":"Beleidigung","pos":"noun","rank":4316,"glosses":["insult (action or speech deliberately intended to be rude)"],"ipa":"/bəˈlaɪ̯dɪɡʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/93/De-Beleidigung2.ogg/De-Beleidigung2.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Beleidigung","plural":"Beleidigungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Es ist eine Beleidigung.","en":"It's an insult.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/201733","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Das ist keine Beleidigung.","en":"That's not an insult.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Sie konnte die Beleidigung nicht ertragen.","en":"She could not put up with the insult.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to bear"}]},{"text":"Ich kann seine Beleidigungen nicht länger hinnehmen.","en":"I can not put up with his insults any longer.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"long","l":"lang"},{"g":"to accept"}]},{"text":"Ich kann mir diese Beleidigungen nicht gefallen lassen.","en":"I can't put up with these insults.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to please"},{"g":"to allow"}]}]}